{"id":"introduction","title":"1. Introduction","phase":null,"phaseName":null,"category":"Documentation","subcategory":"introduction","language":"markdown","description":"","sections":[],"content":"<p><strong>bookshop-multi-buildpack</strong> is a SAP Business Technology Platform (BTP) application that demonstrates the power of <strong>Multi Buildpack</strong> deployment. It combines a <strong>Node.js</strong> frontend (CAP/Express service) with a <strong>Python</strong> backend (ML/AI service) into a single deployable unit using the Multi Buildpack feature of SAP BTP Cloud Foundry.</p><h2>Why Multi Buildpack?</h2><p>Single buildpack deployments are limited to one runtime environment. Multi Buildpack allows you to:<br><ul><li>Run multiple languages/runtimes in the same application container</li><br><li>Keep frontend and backend concerns separated but co-located</li><br><li>Leverage the strengths of Node.js for HTTP/OData/API and Python for ML/Data processing</li><br><li>Simplify deployment topology without managing multiple applications</li><br></ul><br><h2>High-Level Architecture</h2><p>The application combines Node.js and Python runtimes in a single SAP BTP Cloud Foundry container, orchestrated by <code>server.js</code>.</p><div class=\"docs-diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1100 680\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\"> <defs> <linearGradient id=\"grad-client\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#eff6ff\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#dbeafe\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"grad-container\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#f0fdf4\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#dcfce7\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"grad-node\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#f0f9ff\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#e0f2fe\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"grad-python\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#ecfdf5\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#d1fae5\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"grad-services\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#fff7ed\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#ffedd5\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"grad-external\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#fdf2f8\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#fce7f3\" /> </linearGradient> <filter id=\"shadow\" x=\"-8%\" y=\"-8%\" width=\"116%\" height=\"116%\"> <feDropShadow dx=\"0\" dy=\"4\" stdDeviation=\"6\" flood-color=\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08)\" /> </filter> <marker id=\"arr-blue\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z\" fill=\"#2563eb\" /> </marker> <marker id=\"arr-amber\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z\" fill=\"#d97706\" /> </marker> <marker id=\"arr-purple\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z\" fill=\"#9333ea\" /> </marker> <marker id=\"arr-pink\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z\" fill=\"#db2777\" /> </marker> <marker id=\"arr-green\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z\" fill=\"#16a34a\" /> </marker> <style> .node-card { rx: 12; ry: 12; stroke-width: 1.5; filter: url(#shadow); } .txt-hdr { font-family: Ubuntu, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: #0f172a; } .txt-lbl { font-family: Ubuntu, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; fill: #334155; } .txt-sub { font-family: 'SF Mono', Consolas, monospace; font-size: 10px; fill: #64748b; } .flow-path { stroke-dasharray: 6,4; animation: dash 1.6s linear infinite; } @keyframes dash { to { stroke-dashoffset: -20; } } .chip { rx: 4; ry: 4; fill: #ffffff; stroke-width: 1; } .chip-txt { font-family: Ubuntu, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; } </style> </defs> <!-- Background --> <rect width=\"1100\" height=\"680\" fill=\"#ffffff\" rx=\"16\" /> <!-- Title --> <text x=\"550\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"19\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0f172a\">bookshop-multi-buildpack — System Architecture</text> <text x=\"550\" y=\"56\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#64748b\">SAP BTP Cloud Foundry • Multi-Buildpack • Node.js CAP + Persistent Python Worker Bridge</text> <!-- Component Cards --> <!-- 1. Client Layer --> <g transform=\"translate(30, 85)\"> <rect width=\"170\" height=\"420\" fill=\"url(#grad-client)\" stroke=\"#bfdbfe\" class=\"node-card\" /> <text x=\"85\" y=\"32\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\">Client Layer</text> <text x=\"85\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-lbl\">Browsers / Fiori UI</text> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"70\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" /> <text x=\"85\" y=\"87\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">OData V4 (/browse)</text> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"110\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" /> <text x=\"85\" y=\"127\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">AI SSE (/ai/ask)</text> <text x=\"85\" y=\"170\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-lbl\">Clients:</text> <text x=\"85\" y=\"195\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">• Fiori Elements</text> <text x=\"85\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">• Mobile / Web App</text> <text x=\"85\" y=\"235\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">• REST API Clients</text> </g> <!-- 2. Application Container (Droplet) --> <g transform=\"translate(230, 85)\"> <rect width=\"520\" height=\"420\" fill=\"url(#grad-container)\" stroke=\"#86efac\" class=\"node-card\" /> <text x=\"260\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\">SAP BTP Container (Cloud Foundry Droplet)</text> <text x=\"260\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">Co-located Node.js &amp; Python Processes</text> <!-- 2a. Node.js CAP Server --> <rect x=\"20\" y=\"65\" width=\"220\" height=\"330\" fill=\"url(#grad-node)\" stroke=\"#7dd3fc\" class=\"node-card\" /> <text x=\"130\" y=\"90\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\">Node.js CAP Server</text> <text x=\"130\" y=\"110\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-lbl\">@sap/cds v10 + Express</text> <rect x=\"30\" y=\"125\" width=\"160\" height=\"24\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#bae6fd\" /> <text x=\"110\" y=\"141\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">srv/server.js ($PORT)</text> <rect x=\"30\" y=\"160\" width=\"160\" height=\"24\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#bae6fd\" /> <text x=\"110\" y=\"176\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">srv/cat-service.js</text> <rect x=\"30\" y=\"195\" width=\"160\" height=\"24\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#bae6fd\" /> <text x=\"110\" y=\"211\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">srv/ai-service.js</text> <rect x=\"30\" y=\"230\" width=\"160\" height=\"24\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#bae6fd\" /> <text x=\"110\" y=\"246\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">srv/python.js (Bridge)</text> <!-- 2b. Python Worker Process --> <rect x=\"280\" y=\"65\" width=\"220\" height=\"330\" fill=\"url(#grad-python)\" stroke=\"#6ee7b7\" class=\"node-card\" /> <text x=\"390\" y=\"90\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\">Python Worker</text> <text x=\"390\" y=\"110\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-lbl\">Persistent Process</text> <rect x=\"295\" y=\"125\" width=\"190\" height=\"24\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#a7f3d0\" /> <text x=\"390\" y=\"141\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">python/functions.py --worker</text> <rect x=\"295\" y=\"160\" width=\"190\" height=\"24\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#a7f3d0\" /> <text x=\"390\" y=\"176\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">apply_discount() Math</text> <rect x=\"295\" y=\"195\" width=\"190\" height=\"24\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#a7f3d0\" /> <text x=\"390\" y=\"211\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">ask_ai() Token Streamer</text> <rect x=\"295\" y=\"230\" width=\"190\" height=\"24\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#a7f3d0\" /> <text x=\"390\" y=\"246\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">JSON-RPC Loop (stdin/out)</text> </g> <!-- 3. BTP Services Layer --> <g transform=\"translate(780, 85)\"> <rect width=\"290\" height=\"420\" fill=\"url(#grad-services)\" stroke=\"#fed7aa\" class=\"node-card\" /> <text x=\"145\" y=\"32\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\">SAP BTP &amp; External Services</text> <text x=\"145\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-lbl\">Managed Backends</text> <rect x=\"20\" y=\"70\" width=\"250\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#fdba74\" /> <text x=\"145\" y=\"92\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#c2410c\">XSUAA Authentication</text> <text x=\"145\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">OAuth2 / JWT Token Validation</text> <rect x=\"20\" y=\"135\" width=\"250\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#fdba74\" /> <text x=\"145\" y=\"157\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#c2410c\">BTP Destination Service</text> <text x=\"145\" y=\"173\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">Resolves LLM Target &amp; API Key</text> <rect x=\"20\" y=\"200\" width=\"250\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#fdba74\" /> <text x=\"145\" y=\"222\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#c2410c\">HANA Cloud / SQLite DB</text> <text x=\"145\" y=\"238\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">Book &amp; Author Catalog Data</text> <rect x=\"20\" y=\"265\" width=\"250\" height=\"120\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"url(#grad-external)\" stroke=\"#f472b6\" /> <text x=\"145\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#be185d\">NVIDIA AI Core</text> <text x=\"145\" y=\"310\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-lbl\">Llama 3.3 70B Instruct</text> <text x=\"145\" y=\"330\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct</text> <text x=\"145\" y=\"350\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">OpenAI-Compatible Chat API</text> </g> <!-- Explicit Non-Overlapping Connectors (Top Layer) --> <!-- 1. Client -> Node.js CAP Server (HTTPS / OData / SSE) --> <path d=\"M 200,180 L 250,180\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"flow-path\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-blue)\" /> <rect x=\"206\" y=\"169\" width=\"38\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" class=\"chip\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /> <text x=\"225\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"chip-txt\" fill=\"#2563eb\">HTTP</text> <!-- 2. Node.js -> Python Worker (stdin / stdout JSON-RPC Bridge) --> <path d=\"M 470,240 L 510,240\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"flow-path\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-green)\" /> <rect x=\"472\" y=\"229\" width=\"36\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" class=\"chip\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /> <text x=\"490\" y=\"244\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"chip-txt\" fill=\"#16a34a\">IPC</text> <!-- 3. Node.js -> HANA Cloud DB (Bypassing Python completely: drops down from Node card at Y=430, runs below container, goes up to HANA DB at X=920, Y=335) --> <path d=\"M 360,435 L 360,470 L 920,470 L 920,335\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"6,4\" class=\"flow-path\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-amber)\" /> <rect x=\"615\" y=\"457\" width=\"50\" height=\"24\" rx=\"4\" class=\"chip\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /> <text x=\"640\" y=\"473\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"chip-txt\" fill=\"#d97706\">SQL DB</text> <!-- 4. Python Worker -> NVIDIA AI Core (Outbound Chat API) --> <path d=\"M 730,370 L 800,370\" stroke=\"#db2777\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"flow-path\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-pink)\" /> <rect x=\"744\" y=\"359\" width=\"42\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" class=\"chip\" stroke=\"#db2777\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /> <text x=\"765\" y=\"374\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"chip-txt\" fill=\"#db2777\">REST</text> <!-- Table Container (Bottom) --> <g transform=\"translate(30, 505)\"> <rect width=\"1040\" height=\"155\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" rx=\"14\" filter=\"url(#shadow)\" /> <text x=\"520\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0f172a\">Architecture Communication Principles</text> <!-- Card 1 --> <g transform=\"translate(20, 38)\"> <rect width=\"490\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" /> <circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#2563eb\" /> <text x=\"24\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">1</text> <text x=\"44\" y=\"20\" class=\"txt-lbl\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0f172a\">Client Gateway</text> <text x=\"44\" y=\"36\" class=\"txt-sub\" fill=\"#475569\">External traffic hits Node.js CAP on $PORT. Node alone exposes HTTP.</text> </g> <!-- Card 2 --> <g transform=\"translate(530, 38)\"> <rect width=\"490\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" /> <circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#16a34a\" /> <text x=\"24\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">2</text> <text x=\"44\" y=\"20\" class=\"txt-lbl\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0f172a\">Zero-Latency IPC Bridge</text> <text x=\"44\" y=\"36\" class=\"txt-sub\" fill=\"#475569\">Node &amp; Python exchange JSON-RPC via stdin/stdout (0ms overhead).</text> </g> <!-- Card 3 --> <g transform=\"translate(20, 94)\"> <rect width=\"490\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" /> <circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#d97706\" /> <text x=\"24\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">3</text> <text x=\"44\" y=\"20\" class=\"txt-lbl\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0f172a\">BTP Service Bindings</text> <text x=\"44\" y=\"36\" class=\"txt-sub\" fill=\"#475569\">Destination Service resolves target LLM URL &amp; credentials dynamically.</text> </g> <!-- Card 4 --> <g transform=\"translate(530, 94)\"> <rect width=\"490\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" /> <circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#db2777\" /> <text x=\"24\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">4</text> <text x=\"44\" y=\"20\" class=\"txt-lbl\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0f172a\">Isolated Execution</text> <text x=\"44\" y=\"36\" class=\"txt-sub\" fill=\"#475569\">Python process cannot be reached externally, ensuring full network isolation.</text> </g> </g></svg></div><h2>Key Features</h2><ul><li><strong>Dual Runtime</strong>: Node.js (CAP/Express) + Python (Flask/FastAPI) in one container</li><br><li><strong>AI Integration</strong>: <code>/ai/chat</code> endpoint with XSUAA-secured destinations</li><br><li><strong>Service Mesh</strong>: Seamless binding to SAP BTP services (XSUAA, Destination, AI Core)</li><br><li><strong>Multi-Environment</strong>: Production, local, and hybrid deployment configurations</li><br><li><strong>Automated Testing</strong>: Integration tests for both runtimes and service bindings</li><br><li><strong>Developer Friendly</strong>: Beginner-ready guide with downloadable source</li><br></ul>","tags":["introduction"],"details":""}